meta {
  name: Bulk schedule
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/payments/bulk/schedule
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "ids": ["{{paymentId}}"],
    "scheduledFor": "2026-07-15T00:00:00.000Z"
  }
}

docs {
  Admin only. Applies the same `scheduledFor` ISO timestamp to every
  supplied UNSCHEDULED payment and flips the linked Bill to SCHEDULED.
  Per-item dates are out of scope — the bulk action is for "schedule
  all of these for the same day". Items not in UNSCHEDULED fail per
  item with PAYMENT_INVALID_TRANSITION.

  Response shape: `{ results: [{ id, ok, data? | error? }], summary }`.
  Always HTTP 200; empty / duplicate `ids` -> 400 BULK_INVALID_IDS;
  missing or invalid `scheduledFor` -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
  See `bills/bulk/approve.bru` for the full envelope.
}
